  "details": "When looking up or down at moderate to high angles, Selfie Expression `on` will affect the IK too much for lower body.\n\nSince Selfie Expression is primarily a face cam, I wouldn't expect it to have IK weighting below the chest/spine bone. In real life even if I move around the camera, it is mainly my head and my chest moving, my spine and root/hip bones (IRL) don't move much if at all.\n\nFirst image: Selfie Expression `off` (normal looking)\n\nSecond image: Selfie Expression `on` (too much lower body IK weirdness)",
